fix(interaction): prevent bar collapse while a ContextMenu is open

Hold the bar open whenever a shortcut or ribbon ContextMenu is open:
- Add IsContextMenuOpen to IDockStateService and DockInteractionController (sharing HoldOpenFromTransientState with IsPinned) so grace collapse never triggers while a ContextMenu popup is open, and resumes normally upon close.
- Expose BeginContextMenuCommand and EndContextMenuCommand in DockBarViewModel.
- Add ContextMenuHoldBehavior (OpenedCommand/ClosedCommand) and bind it on both ContextMenus in MainWindow.xaml without code-behind logic.
- Add unit and XAML contract tests (503/503 passing in Debug and Release).

Refs: RF02, RF03, RF04, HU02, E3-CA3, E4-CA4, E5-CA4, OBS-01